{{!
    @template format_dari/chatbox_icon

    One decorative study-tool icon for Ask Dari. Exactly one of the flags is set; the icon is
    aria-hidden because the button it sits in carries the visible label.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * isstructure, isconcepts, isworkplace, ispractice, ischecklist bool Which icon to draw.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "ispractice": true
    }
}}
